0..75 Comment "// A natural literal read through a reader: run in a body, and refused as a"
76..102 Comment "// definition\'s own value."
103..105 Comment "//"
106..178 Comment "// A literal at a type a `FromNat` model carries is the reader\'s call. A"
179..253 Comment "// function\'s body runs that call, so the literal there settles to a leaf."
254..256 Comment "//"
257..330 Comment "// A definition\'s own value runs no computation, so the reader\'s call has"
331..407 Comment "// nothing to run before. The refusal names the literal and asks for a body."
408..410 Comment "//"
411..457 Comment "// - see: #4806 — the refusal at the literal"
458..520 Comment "// - owes: #4812 — a definition\'s own value that runs a call"
521..601 Comment "// - see: `ledger/features/literal-reading.gandr` — the literals readers carry"
